   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pure Gold**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Cheshire County**: back after 24 archived shows (792 days) [2]\n- **Commandante**: back after 47 archived shows (1542 days) [2]\n- **Alpha Chum Gatherer**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **The Boys Are Back in Town/Ignition (Remix)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2013-06-14.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 85 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Banana, Enoch [1]\n- Baptist Generals duo joined John Darnielle and Peter Hughes for this performance [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2013-06-14.aud.flac16**: source: AUD>Zoom H2 recorder [1]. Also: Audio captured via Zoom H2 built-in microphones, normalized and split in wav format [1]",
